        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kylie Jenner, Kendall Jenner, Emily Kai Bock\n- Events: 2014 Much Music Video Awards, 2014 Prism Prize\n- Organizations: E!, Arcade Fire\n- Products: Keeping Up with the Kardashians, Kylie Cosmetics, Afterlife\n\nFacts:\n- In 2014, Kendall Jenner and Kylie Jenner served as co-hosts of the 2014 Much Music Video Awards.\n- In 2014, Emily Kai Bock won the 2014 Prism Prize for her video for Arcade Fire's song \"Afterlife.\"\n- In 2014, Emily Kai Bock was nominated for Director of the Year at the 2014 Much Music Video Awards.\n- Kylie Jenner is best known for starring in E!'s reality television series \"Keeping Up with the Kardashians\" since age nine.\n- Kylie Jenner is best known for her eponymous cosmetics brand and her large social media presence.",
